        "page_index": 0,
        "reading_text": "CEDAR & VANE LTD\n22 Quartermaster Row, Portsmouth PO1 2AF\n9 February 2027\nMs. R. Whitfield\nFacilities Director\nAlder Court Estates\n12 Beacon Terrace, Portsmouth PO2 8LL\nDear Ms. Whitfield,\nThank you for meeting our site team last Thursday. The visit confirmed that the planned\nmaintenance schedule for Alder Court can begin in March without disturbing tenants.\nEnclosed with this letter are the signed service invoice and the receipt for the replacement valve\nassembly.\nOur engineers will arrive before eight in the morning, so the loading bay should be clear the\nevening before. If the parking permit for the service van has expired, please tell the front desk\nand we will issue a new one the same day.\nThe revised contract rate applies from 1 March 2027 and is fixed for twelve months. No other\nterms change.\nYours sincerely,\nT. Marsh\nClient Services Lead\nCedar & Vane Ltd\ncc: Building manager file\nCedar & Vane Ltd - registered in England (fictional entity)",
